    "domainDetail": "native.capability-unavailable",
    "operationalCarrier": "CommandEnvelope.availability in the ORIGINAL invocation that selected the capability: a CapabilityAvailabilityV1 whose per-step CapabilityAvailabilityNoticeV1 entries carry the complete ownership tuple in typed fields - capabilityId, languageMode and the unit own workspaceRoot - as section 1.4 defines. A DoctorResult.defects[] entry or a StepTermination.domainDetail may still carry a generic environment note, but neither is this route: a StepTermination.domainDetail is singular where one invocation has many absences, a doctor report is a DIFFERENT invocation, and a DomainDetail subject cannot hold the ownership tuple without discarding workspaceRoot",
